    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d430">

                <pb facs="0432" n="423" sameAs="frus:frus1938v05/pg423"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.2531/241: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Frost</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-01-11T16:00:00-05:00">January 11, 1938—4
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>5. Your 80, November 22, 7 p.m.,<anchor n="7" xml:id="d430-f1"/> and 9, January
                    6, 1 p.m.<anchor n="8" xml:id="d430-f2"/> Please report whether <hi
                        rendition="#italic">modus vivendi</hi> signed January 6, 1938 went into
                    force either provisionally or definitively in Chile on day of signature. If it
                    is not now in force, when will it become effective?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
